#: ../../source/docs/ros-apriltag-detection.rst:5
#: 7cba3b15c37443e2b620b4da2f8c89f6
msgid "Indoor autonomous flight with ArduCopter, ROS and AprilTag Detection"
msgstr "基于 ArduCopter、ROS 和 AprilTag 检测的室内自主飞行"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-apriltag-detection.rst:7
#: 2a095ca3f72d41bdb853ac77450469ba
msgid ""
"This wiki page describes how to setup a system capable to realize indoor "
"autonomous flight. The system is based on a quadcopter with a Raspberry Pi 3"
" and a USB camera. Images from the camera are used to calculate poses "
"estimation on the Raspberry Pi and the result are sent as MAVLink messages "
"to the Flight Controller. The camera is downward looking and on the floor "
"there is an AprilTag board like this:"
msgstr ""
"本 wiki 页面介绍如何搭建能够实现室内自主飞行的系统。该系统基于配备树莓派 3 和 USB "
"摄像头的四旋翼飞行器。摄像头图像用于在树莓派上计算位姿估计，结果以 MAVLink 消息发送到飞控。摄像头朝下，地板上放置如下所示的 AprilTag "
"板："

#: ../../source/docs/ros-apriltag-detection.rst:14
#: e7a5a968c6f24541b4e064095411f89b
msgid "System overview"
msgstr "系统概述"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-apriltag-detection.rst:16
#: d6aa1f80252040a0b4b7a6ebd8866456
msgid ""
"The system uses `ROS <http://www.ros.org/>`__ for all the tasks it has to "
"do. The images from a `USB camera module "
"<https://www.tindie.com/products/exlene/8mp-usb-camera-module-for-"
"linuxwind7wind8/>`__ are captured by `usb_cam node "
"<http://wiki.ros.org/usb_cam>`__, the pose estimations are calculated by "
"`apriltag_ros node <https://github.com/AprilRobotics/apriltag_ros>`__, then "
"processed by `vision_to_mavros node "
"<https://github.com/hoangthien94/vision_to_mavros>`__, and the relevant "
"messages are sent to the Flight Controller using `MAVROS "
"<http://wiki.ros.org/mavros>`__. All of these ROS packages runs on the "
"Raspberry Pi 3."
msgstr ""
"该系统使用 `ROS <http://www.ros.org/>`__ 完成其所有任务。`USB 摄像头模块 "
"<https://www.tindie.com/products/exlene/8mp-usb-camera-module-for-"
"linuxwind7wind8/>`__ 的图像由 `usb_cam 节点 <http://wiki.ros.org/usb_cam>`__ "
"采集，位姿估计由 `apriltag_ros 节点 <https://github.com/AprilRobotics/apriltag_ros>`__"
" 计算，再由 `vision_to_mavros 节点 "
"<https://github.com/hoangthien94/vision_to_mavros>`__ 处理，相关消息通过 `MAVROS "
"<http://wiki.ros.org/mavros>`__ 发送到飞控。所有这些 ROS 软件包均运行在树莓派 3 上。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-apriltag-detection.rst:18
#: a9a30163a9e743cfac466130f4467214
msgid ""
"The ``usb_cam`` node publishes ``camera/image`` and ``camera/camera_info`` "
"topics, the ``apriltag_ros`` node subscribes to these topics and publish a "
"camera_pose message to the ``mavros/vision_pose/pose`` topic, ``mavros`` "
"translates ROS messages in MAVLink messages and send it to the Flight "
"Controller."
msgstr ""
"``usb_cam`` 节点发布 ``camera/image`` 和 ``camera/camera_info`` "
"话题，``apriltag_ros`` 节点订阅这些话题并向 ``mavros/vision_pose/pose`` 话题发布 camera_pose "
"消息，``mavros`` 将 ROS 消息转换为 MAVLink 消息并发送到飞控。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-apriltag-detection.rst:20
#: 44175721d3954d3a9bc97962867d1b1a
msgid ""
"The messages `SET_GPS_GLOBAL_ORIGIN "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#SET_GPS_GLOBAL_ORIGIN>`__ and a "
"`SET_HOME_POSITION "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#SET_HOME_POSITION>`__ are sent "
"before the system is ready to run. Two methods of setting EKF home:"
msgstr ""
"系统就绪运行前需发送 `SET_GPS_GLOBAL_ORIGIN "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#SET_GPS_GLOBAL_ORIGIN>`__ 和 "
"`SET_HOME_POSITION "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#SET_HOME_POSITION>`__ 消息。设置 EKF "
"原点的两种方法："

#: ../../source/docs/ros-apriltag-detection.rst:22
#: c0c14c3043504762a6b8289793bfaf31
msgid "with Mission Planner (Right Click > Set EKF Home > Set Origin)"
msgstr "使用 Mission Planner（右键 > 设置 EKF 原点 > 设置原点）"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-apriltag-detection.rst:24
#: 5b2d495dbe004ad8a2c4b020c4a06d75
msgid ""
"with the script `set_origin.py "
"<https://github.com/anbello/aruco_gridboard/blob/master/script/set_origin.py>`__."
msgstr ""
"使用脚本 `set_origin.py "
"<https://github.com/anbello/aruco_gridboard/blob/master/script/set_origin.py>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-apriltag-detection.rst:26
#: 2b9d6a4f2e594bc0ac3393c77fed3e6c
msgid ""
"The Flight Controller and the Raspberry Pi 3 on the quadcopter are connected"
" via serial port whereas the Raspberry Pi 3 and the desktop PC are connected"
" via WiFi. The desktop PC is used only for configuration and visualization "
"purposes. `RViz <http://wiki.ros.org/rviz>`__ is used for visualization on "
"PC in ROS."
msgstr ""
"四旋翼上的飞控与树莓派 3 通过串口连接，树莓派 3 与台式电脑通过 WiFi 连接。台式电脑仅用于配置和可视化。ROS 中使用 `RViz "
"<http://wiki.ros.org/rviz>`__ 在电脑上进行可视化。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-apriltag-detection.rst:29
#: 1a7f06cb700d47299e3c847a4b72e523
msgid "Components of the system"
msgstr "系统组成"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-apriltag-detection.rst:31
#: 11dbdbf93863471386b8f21de6098868
msgid ""
"A small quadcopter equipped with `Pixhack Autopilot "
"<http://www.helipal.com/pixhack-autopilot-kit.html>`__, `CUAV PX4FLOW "
"<https://store.cuav.net/index.php?id_product=52&id_product_attribute=0&rewrite=cuav-"
"px4flow-21-optical-flow-sensor-smart-camera-for-px4-pixhawk-flight-control-"
"without-sonar-or-with-sonar&controller=product&id_lang=3>`__, `TeraRanger "
"One <https://ardupilot.org/copter/docs/common-teraranger-one-"
"rangefinder.html>`__. With this setup, you can follow the wiki to achieve "
"`non-GPS flight with PX4FLOW <https://ardupilot.org/copter/docs/common-"
"px4flow-overview.html>`__."
msgstr ""
"配备 `Pixhack 飞控 <http://www.helipal.com/pixhack-autopilot-kit.html>`__、`CUAV "
"PX4FLOW "
"<https://store.cuav.net/index.php?id_product=52&id_product_attribute=0&rewrite=cuav-"
"px4flow-21-optical-flow-sensor-smart-camera-for-px4-pixhawk-flight-control-"
"without-sonar-or-with-sonar&controller=product&id_lang=3>`__、`TeraRanger One"
" <https://ardupilot.org/copter/docs/common-teraranger-one-"
"rangefinder.html>`__ 的小型四旋翼。通过此配置，可参照 wiki 实现 `PX4FLOW 无 GPS 飞行 "
"<https://ardupilot.org/copter/docs/common-px4flow-overview.html>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-apriltag-detection.rst:33
#: b7a288902ee849aa9478b0a3f2c4ab6d
msgid ""
"`Raspberry Pi 3 Model B <https://www.raspberrypi.org/products/raspberry-"
"pi-3-model-b/>`__ with a 16GB micro SD card running `Ubuntu Mate 16.04 "
"<https://ubuntu-mate.org/>`__, connected to a `USB camera "
"<https://www.tindie.com/products/exlene/8mp-usb-camera-module-for-"
"linuxwind7wind8/>`__ down-facing to the ground, with the x-axis of the "
"camera to the right."
msgstr ""
"`树莓派 3 Model B <https://www.raspberrypi.org/products/raspberry-"
"pi-3-model-b/>`__，搭配 16GB micro SD 卡，运行 `Ubuntu Mate 16.04 <https://ubuntu-"
"mate.org/>`__，连接朝下对准地面的 `USB 摄像头 "
"<https://www.tindie.com/products/exlene/8mp-usb-camera-module-for-"
"linuxwind7wind8/>`__，摄像头 x 轴朝右。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-apriltag-detection.rst:36
#: 403a96f5dd824b20bcd0f497c263c21b
msgid ""
"There is no hard restriction on the mounting orientation of the camera "
"beside it being down-facing, but frame transformation is needed to align the"
" frames for different camera orientation."
msgstr "摄像头安装方向除朝下外无硬性限制，但不同摄像头朝向需要进行坐标系变换以对齐参考系。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-apriltag-detection.rst:39
#: 122a04bf6fba48fcac35e66edc7ac5b0
msgid "Software setup"
msgstr "软件设置"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-apriltag-detection.rst:41
#: b990d4e7cfd54c64a71d037bd304dd3f
msgid ":ref:`Install ROS and MAVROS <ros-install>`."
msgstr ":ref:`安装 ROS 和 MAVROS <ros-install>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-apriltag-detection.rst:43
#: e24836567cf54d7cba44e6c88e3af25d
msgid ":ref:`Connect RPi to ArduPilot with MAVROS <ros-connecting>`."
msgstr ":ref:`通过 MAVROS 将 RPi 连接到 ArduPilot <ros-connecting>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-apriltag-detection.rst:45
#: b605ef9794144b74b66a38de00c67721
msgid "Install ROS driver for your camera:"
msgstr "为摄像头安装 ROS 驱动："

#: ../../source/docs/ros-apriltag-detection.rst:47
#: 2edbe433113c44cfa4617fcf7a3e312b
msgid "For USB camera: ``sudo apt-get install ros-kinetic-usb-cam``"
msgstr "USB 摄像头：``sudo apt-get install ros-kinetic-usb-cam``"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-apriltag-detection.rst:49
#: c5608f59c70546e58566a958ba7e0fec
msgid ""
"For RPi camera module: you can follow `this instruction "
"<https://larrylisky.com/2016/11/24/enabling-raspberry-pi-camera-v2-under-"
"ubuntu-mate/>`__ to enable the camera, then install `raspicam_node "
"<https://github.com/UbiquityRobotics/raspicam_node>`__."
msgstr ""
"RPi 摄像头模块：可参照 `此说明 <https://larrylisky.com/2016/11/24/enabling-raspberry-pi-"
"camera-v2-under-ubuntu-mate/>`__ 启用摄像头，然后安装 `raspicam_node "
"<https://github.com/UbiquityRobotics/raspicam_node>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-apriltag-detection.rst:51
#: 9c13331bad6243dbb82cc27f63715e8c
msgid ""
"Install `Apriltag library <https://github.com/AprilRobotics/apriltag>`__,  "
"`Apriltag ROS wrapper <https://github.com/AprilRobotics/apriltag_ros>`__ and"
" `vision_to_mavros <https://github.com/hoangthien94/vision_to_mavros.git>`__"
" packages."
msgstr ""
"安装 `Apriltag 库 <https://github.com/AprilRobotics/apriltag>`__、`Apriltag ROS "
"封装 <https://github.com/AprilRobotics/apriltag_ros>`__ 和 `vision_to_mavros "
"<https://github.com/hoangthien94/vision_to_mavros.git>`__ 软件包。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-apriltag-detection.rst:70
#: cdaf1742c2e3436bbf20a0356a15d160
msgid "Camera calibration"
msgstr "摄像头标定"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-apriltag-detection.rst:72
#: d69ef6b28f504edf8ad39fd760f84e28
msgid ""
"Follow the `ROS wiki "
"<http://wiki.ros.org/camera_calibration/Tutorials/MonocularCalibration>`__ "
"to calibrate and obtain the calibration file for your camera."
msgstr ""
"参照 `ROS wiki "
"<http://wiki.ros.org/camera_calibration/Tutorials/MonocularCalibration>`__ "
"对摄像头进行标定并获取标定文件。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-apriltag-detection.rst:74
#: 7f478ed6243a41588b6fe41de32ddb0f
msgid ""
"Replace the ``camera_info_url param`` in the `gsoc.launch "
"<https://github.com/hoangthien94/apriltags2_ros/blob/master/apriltag_ros/launch/gsoc.launch#L13>`__"
" file with the correct path to the calibration file."
msgstr ""
"将 `gsoc.launch "
"<https://github.com/hoangthien94/apriltags2_ros/blob/master/apriltag_ros/launch/gsoc.launch#L13>`__"
" 文件中的 ``camera_info_url param`` 替换为标定文件的正确路径。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-apriltag-detection.rst:77
#: 0cc4e0656be545368030adf2d501e9ee
msgid "Prepare the tags board"
msgstr "准备标签板"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-apriltag-detection.rst:79
#: 9cd7a44282a7429d80ee1d531db3c7ba
msgid ""
"You can print out an `example A3 size tag "
"<https://github.com/hoangthien94/apriltags2_ros/blob/master/apriltag_ros/config/A3_bundle.pdf>`__."
msgstr ""
"可以打印出 `A3 尺寸示例标签 "
"<https://github.com/hoangthien94/apriltags2_ros/blob/master/apriltag_ros/config/A3_bundle.pdf>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-apriltag-detection.rst:81
#: ec9eca01f60f4a25b4554ec40c3a0516
msgid ""
"Depends on your printer setting, the actual size and location of the tags "
"might be slightly different. Measure the true dimension of the tags and "
"modify the `layout file "
"<https://github.com/hoangthien94/apriltags2_ros/blob/master/apriltag_ros/config/A3_bundle.yaml>`__"
" accordingly."
msgstr ""
"根据打印机设置，标签的实际尺寸和位置可能略有差异。请测量标签真实尺寸并相应修改 `布局文件 "
"<https://github.com/hoangthien94/apriltags2_ros/blob/master/apriltag_ros/config/A3_bundle.yaml>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-apriltag-detection.rst:85
#: 060c69108be54968adf38b027df1c8da
msgid ""
"Pre-generated tags images can be found at `apriltag-imgs "
"<https://github.com/AprilRobotics/apriltag-imgs>`__. You can also design "
"your own tags with `apriltag-generation "
"<https://github.com/AprilRobotics/apriltag-generation>`__."
msgstr ""
"预生成的标签图像可在 `apriltag-imgs <https://github.com/AprilRobotics/apriltag-"
"imgs>`__ 找到。也可使用 `apriltag-generation "
"<https://github.com/AprilRobotics/apriltag-generation>`__ 设计自定义标签。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-apriltag-detection.rst:88
#: 89cc8ed65a6743ac9aebe61eabbb434b
msgid "Configure ArduPilot"
msgstr "配置 ArduPilot"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-apriltag-detection.rst:90
#: c42b8d1d363a4a15b005fd7d86520018
msgid ""
"Connect to the flight controller with a ground station (i.e. Mission "
"Planner) and check that the following parameters are set as shown below:"
msgstr "使用地面站（如 Mission Planner）连接飞行控制器，并确认以下参数按如下设置："

#: ../../source/docs/ros-apriltag-detection.rst:112
#: f807f34554c24c73a02d2003d7452834
msgid "Instruction to reproduce the system"
msgstr "系统复现说明"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-apriltag-detection.rst:115
#: a4d71961804648dc8ebf5cd722457130
msgid "1. Running all the nodes"
msgstr "1. 运行所有节点"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-apriltag-detection.rst:117
#: ee21171e61994d2f97383dafabbd20e5
msgid ""
"First, let’s test each ROS node separately and fix any problems that arise:"
msgstr "首先，分别测试每个 ROS 节点并解决出现的任何问题："

#: ../../source/docs/ros-apriltag-detection.rst:119
#: 4c0ba2d1fa814a8d97c4f6dcdb378e47
msgid "``usb_cam`` node:"
msgstr "``usb_cam`` 节点："

#: ../../source/docs/ros-apriltag-detection.rst:121
#: 3423a54fb3094763958644f3ab89d7ae
msgid "On RPi: ``roslaunch usb_cam usb_cam-test.launch``"
msgstr "在 RPi 上：``roslaunch usb_cam usb_cam-test.launch``"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-apriltag-detection.rst:123
#: 5812cc939449406798cb0ef248e976de
msgid ""
"If RPi is not connected to a display, view the raw image on PC with Linux "
"Ubuntu: ``export ROS_MATER_URI=http://<rpi-ip>:11311 && rqt_image_view``"
msgstr ""
"若 RPi 未连接显示器，可在 Linux Ubuntu 电脑上查看原始图像：``export ROS_MATER_URI=http://<rpi-"
"ip>:11311 && rqt_image_view``"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-apriltag-detection.rst:125
#: c55c024fe5a74bde82f14bf098dad73d
msgid "Verify that there are images coming from the camera."
msgstr "确认摄像头有图像输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-apriltag-detection.rst:127
#: 76322542e2184dce8dd43b13cc2995ba
msgid "``MAVROS`` node:"
msgstr "``MAVROS`` 节点："

#: ../../source/docs/ros-apriltag-detection.rst:129
#: b82bdba3e9e146e7ba8a0defd2966ff2
msgid ""
"On RPi: ``roslaunch mavros apm.launch fcu_url:=<tty-port>:<baud-rate>``"
msgstr ""
"在 RPi 上：``roslaunch mavros apm.launch fcu_url:=<tty-port>:<baud-rate>``"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-apriltag-detection.rst:131
#: 1d7451b6608f4fada720bb33471568a7
msgid ""
"Verify that MAVROS is running OK. For example, ``rostopic echo "
"/mavros/state`` should show that FCU is “CONNECTED”."
msgstr ""
"确认 MAVROS 运行正常。例如，``rostopic echo /mavros/state`` 应显示 FCU 状态为「CONNECTED」。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-apriltag-detection.rst:133
#: 33e6ba29593a405998b6ad4700bacaac
msgid "``Apriltag node`` and ``vision_to_mavros`` node:"
msgstr "``Apriltag node`` 和 ``vision_to_mavros`` 节点："

#: ../../source/docs/ros-apriltag-detection.rst:135
#: a384dc1bb55141a9a5ce6ab00a55de55
msgid ""
"Make sure the ``camera_info_url`` points to the correct path to your "
"camera’s calibration file."
msgstr "确保 ``camera_info_url`` 指向摄像头标定文件的正确路径。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-apriltag-detection.rst:137
#: 6a603c6f47c24cecb86faf52faf4a36e
msgid "On RPi: ``roslaunch vision_to_mavros apriltags_to_mavros.launch``"
msgstr "在 RPi 上：``roslaunch vision_to_mavros apriltags_to_mavros.launch``"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-apriltag-detection.rst:139
#: e5b50a143f14415c8063e074fb2f7f9c
msgid ""
"Open up RViz and view ``/tf`` and ``/mavros/vision_pose/pose`` topics. With "
"``/tf``, you should see the camera pose in the tag frame, with z-axis "
"pointing downwards. If your camera’s x-axis is pointing to the right, then "
"``/mavros/vision_pose/pose`` will be aligned with body frame. If the "
"camera’s x-axis is pointing in a different direction, you need to modify the"
" params of ``vision_to_mavros`` accordingly."
msgstr ""
"打开 RViz，查看 ``/tf`` 和 ``/mavros/vision_pose/pose`` 话题。通过 "
"``/tf``，可以看到标签坐标系中的摄像头位姿，z 轴朝下。若摄像头 x 轴朝右，则 ``/mavros/vision_pose/pose`` "
"将与机体坐标系对齐。若摄像头 x 轴朝向其他方向，需相应修改 ``vision_to_mavros`` 的参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-apriltag-detection.rst:142
#: 89e751c16bbe40fc935968e8b4401e35
msgid "2. Ground test"
msgstr "2. 地面测试"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-apriltag-detection.rst:143
#: bfcd20acb26b4e47aa22f0f1849665a6
msgid "If each node can run successfully, you can perform ground test:"
msgstr "若各节点均能成功运行，可进行地面测试："

#: ../../source/docs/ros-apriltag-detection.rst:145
#: 897f48fe1be34b50826fa99641434bc7
msgid ""
"On RPi: launch all the nodes as described above. View the topic "
"``/mavros/vision_pose/pose`` on RViz. Move the vehicle around and see if the"
" pose changes according to the movement."
msgstr ""
"在 RPi 上：按上述说明启动所有节点。在 RViz 中查看 ``/mavros/vision_pose/pose`` "
"话题。移动飞行器，观察位姿是否随移动而变化。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-apriltag-detection.rst:147
#: 7c7ac501cc9e4b75a66e08c6602c1ac5
msgid ""
"**Set EKF home** by sending the MAVLink messages `SET_GPS_GLOBAL_ORIGIN "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#SET_GPS_GLOBAL_ORIGIN>`__ and "
"`SET_HOME_POSITION "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#SET_HOME_POSITION>`__."
msgstr ""
"**设置 EKF 原点**，发送 MAVLink 消息 `SET_GPS_GLOBAL_ORIGIN "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#SET_GPS_GLOBAL_ORIGIN>`__ 和 "
"`SET_HOME_POSITION "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#SET_HOME_POSITION>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-apriltag-detection.rst:149
#: 363d368de41a4bdf87d169cf9d6cdcfb
msgid ""
"**Using Mission Planner**: Right-click on any point on the map > ``Set Home "
"Here`` > ``Set EKF Origin Here``."
msgstr ""
"**使用 Mission Planner**：在地图任意位置右键 > ``Set Home Here`` > ``Set EKF Origin "
"Here``。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-apriltag-detection.rst:154
#: 8c22965270254ac8ad4ecb6b3bef1923
msgid ""
"**Using code**: you can use this Python script `set_origin.py "
"<https://github.com/anbello/aruco_gridboard/blob/master/script/set_origin.py>`__."
msgstr ""
"**使用代码**：可使用此 Python 脚本 `set_origin.py "
"<https://github.com/anbello/aruco_gridboard/blob/master/script/set_origin.py>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-apriltag-detection.rst:156
#: 343882dff99044cd956e9931ed87bbb0
msgid ""
"Install ``pymavlink``: Follow the instructions `here "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/pymavlink#installation>`__."
msgstr ""
"安装 ``pymavlink``：请按照 `此处 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/pymavlink#installation>`__ 的说明操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-apriltag-detection.rst:158
#: caa579d1c3ea42eab35a8ac9896d2fcd
msgid "Run the script: ``rosrun vision_to_mavros set_origin.py``."
msgstr "运行脚本：``rosrun vision_to_mavros set_origin.py``。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-apriltag-detection.rst:160
#: 33c2445c1b9b47b0852df05a47fa9702
msgid ""
"After the origin of the EKF is set, a quadcopter icon will appear on the "
"map."
msgstr "设置 EKF 原点后，地图上将出现四旋翼图标。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-apriltag-detection.rst:162
#: dca8e2e9c9cd44b8b282f9769bb0dfbf
msgid ""
"Hold the vehicle up, move around while keeping the tag board in the field of"
" view of the camera, and observe the trajectory of the vehicle on Mission "
"Planner."
msgstr "手持飞行器移动，保持标签板在摄像头视野内，观察 Mission Planner 上的飞行器轨迹。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-apriltag-detection.rst:164
#: f5b24d7c75ed4cc78d3adff3f08d595b
msgid "If the last step is successful, you can go ahead with flight test."
msgstr "若上一步成功，即可进行飞行测试。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-apriltag-detection.rst:167
#: 5aea68381e03440db14b4ec63d0e79d7
msgid "3. Flight test"
msgstr "3. 飞行测试"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-apriltag-detection.rst:169
#: dffd8dd22c1f4446a2ba056dd32cde0c
msgid "Takeoff in Stabilize to check whether the quadcopter is stable."
msgstr "在自稳模式下起飞，检查四旋翼是否稳定。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-apriltag-detection.rst:171
#: ad67ec3dcf574430b0d12272ac8bfd85
msgid ""
"At a height that the camera can have a good view of the tags, switch to Alt-"
"Hold to adjust level position. Observe the feedback on RViz as well as "
"Mission Planner to see if tags are detected."
msgstr ""
"在摄像头能清晰看到标签的高度，切换到定高模式调整水平位置。观察 RViz 和 Mission Planner 上的反馈，确认标签是否被检测到。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-apriltag-detection.rst:173
#: e63df30c6ea84917a0b3cb98ef02a5ca
msgid ""
"Take a look at Mission Planner map, confirm that the system is still "
"tracking."
msgstr "查看 Mission Planner 地图，确认系统仍在追踪。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-apriltag-detection.rst:175
#: e1eb4378a2dd4771ac0a05542881112d
msgid ""
"Switch to Loiter, but always ready to switch back to Alt-Hold if anything "
"goes awry."
msgstr "切换到定点悬停模式，但随时准备在出现异常时切换回定高模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-apriltag-detection.rst:177
#: 44c3162097364d7588f7151aa6fefda5
msgid "Otherwise, the quadcopter should hover stably above the tags."
msgstr "否则，四旋翼应在标签上方稳定悬停。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-apriltag-detection.rst:180
#: bc0a24cf9ade4c8f97f80d093cda5c95
msgid ""
"For external navigation data to be accepted by EKF, the data rate needs to "
"be higher than a certain threshold (usually 10Hz). If you are also using "
"RPi, firstly we need to tune the params related to computational costs to "
"achieve an acceptable detection rate, either by increasing ``tag_decimate``,"
" which will increase detection rate at the expense of lower accuracy, or "
"increase ``tag_threads``, if you are not running anything else and have some"
" CPU to spare. The related tuning parameters are located in the file "
"`settings.yaml "
"<https://github.com/hoangthien94/apriltags2_ros/blob/master/apriltag_ros/config/settings.yaml>`__."
msgstr ""
"EKF 接受外部导航数据需要数据速率高于某一阈值（通常为 10Hz）。若同时使用 "
"RPi，首先需要调整与计算开销相关的参数以达到可接受的检测速率，可通过增大 ``tag_decimate`` （以牺牲精度换取更高检测速率）或在 CPU"
" 有余量时增大 ``tag_threads`` 来实现。相关调参参数位于 `settings.yaml "
"<https://github.com/hoangthien94/apriltags2_ros/blob/master/apriltag_ros/config/settings.yaml>`__"
" 文件中。"

